/**
 * CCTV camera feed definitions, grouped by location.
 * Each map entry will appear as a labelled section in the Settings sidebar.
 *
 * Structure: Map<string, object[]>
 *   key      {string}  Group label (place name).
 *   value    {Array}   Array of camera entries for that group, in display order.
 *
 * Camera entry fields:
 *   title    {string}  Display name shown on the feed tile and modal.
 *   url      {string}  Static JPEG/MJPEG image URL, or an HLS (.m3u8) manifest URL.
 *   type     {string}  Optional. "image" (default) or "hls". "hls" sources are
 *                       played through a <video> element via hls.js instead of
 *                       being rendered as an <img>. If omitted, a URL ending in
 *                       `.m3u8` is auto-detected as "hls".
 *   refresh  {boolean} true = append cache-busting timestamp on every timer tick.
 *                       Ignored for "hls" sources, which refresh themselves.
 */
